# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraform.tfstate.lock.info

# Real values stay local — commit only the *.example files
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# Never commit credentials
*.json
!**/package.json
.terraform.lock.hcl
